Ticket: Improve Wi-Fi Performance with Beamforming

Issue:
PC1 was connected to the wireless router, but the wireless data rate was lower than expected.

Action Taken:
Opened the wireless router GUI and enabled Beamforming under Advanced Wireless Settings.

Testing:
Checked PC1's Best Data Rate before and after enabling Beamforming.

Result:
The Best Data Rate increased after Beamforming was enabled.

Resolution:
Beamforming was enabled successfully, improving wireless performance for PC1.

Concept Practised:
Wi-Fi optimisation, beamforming, wireless signal performance.
